# OmniPeople — locked brand & names

## Product brand (user-chosen — do not rename without asking)
- **Display name:** OmniPeople
- **Source of truth:** `src/lib/brand.ts` (`PRODUCT_NAME`)
- **Concept:** All-in-one platform for HR people ops + payroll
- **Co-pilot voice:** Omni Co-Pilot
- Repo folder may remain `hr-payroll-ng`; user-facing strings use **OmniPeople**

## Portal users (only two logins)
- **Super Admin** — clears payroll approval, sensitive change requests, Settings
- **HR** — same workspace; seeks Super Admin clearance on payroll & sensitive updates
- No employee self-service portal

## Employee status / sex labels
Use exact labels in `src/lib/employees/status.ts`.

## Approval language
- HR submits for Super Admin approval; Super Admin is notified and approves or sends back
